  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "im using the knuckles DV prototype. I've noticed randomly when playing in vrchat my avatar hands will shift to the left or right of where my controllers are. i was able to reproduce the problem when i rotate my view to one side so that my hands are out of my fov. then when i turn back my hands have shifted positions. once i move my player with the left thumb stick it snaps back to where it should be. i was unable to reproduce the problem with standard vive wands so it seams isolated to my knuckles. i recorded a video showing the affect in game ( https://youtu.be/TxjatLi65Js ). it feels like once its out of my fov somethings being culled and causes my hand to drift.",
